{"title": "Breezeswift Speed", "pageid": 28263, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Breezeswift_Speed", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Breezeswift Speed</b> is a passive feature that increases a monk's attacks.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>While using <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Step_of_the_Wind\" title=\"Step of the Wind\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Step_of_the_Wind_Dash_Icon.webp/25px-Step_of_the_Wind_Dash_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Step_of_the_Wind_Dash_Icon.webp/38px-Step_of_the_Wind_Dash_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Step_of_the_Wind_Dash_Icon.webp/50px-Step_of_the_Wind_Dash_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Step of the Wind\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Step_of_the_Wind_Dash_Icon.webp/25px-Step_of_the_Wind_Dash_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Step_of_the_Wind_Dash_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Step_of_the_Wind\" title=\"Step of the Wind\">Step of the Wind</a>, your next <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a> has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> and deals an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">1d8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a> damage. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Swift_as_Wind\"> Condition: Swift as Wind </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Swift_as_Wind_(Condition)\" title=\"Swift as Wind (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Generic_Force_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Force_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Generic_Force_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Force_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Generic_Force_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Force_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Swift as Wind\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Generic_Force_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Force_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/Generic_Force_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Swift_as_Wind_(Condition)\" title=\"Swift as Wind (Condition)\">Swift as Wind</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Your next weapon attack has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a>. That attack deals an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">1d8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Garb_of_the_Land_and_Sky\" title=\"Garb of the Land and Sky\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Garb_of_the_Land_and_Sky_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Garb_of_the_Land_and_Sky_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Garb_of_the_Land_and_Sky_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Garb_of_the_Land_and_Sky_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Garb_of_the_Land_and_Sky_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Garb_of_the_Land_and_Sky_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Garb_of_the_Land_and_Sky_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Garb_of_the_Land_and_Sky_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Garb_of_the_Land_and_Sky_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Garb_of_the_Land_and_Sky\" title=\"Garb of the Land and Sky\">Garb of the Land and Sky</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The effect of Breezeswift Speed is dispelled when landing a successful weapon attack, but can boost attacks other than with proper weapons.\n<ul><li>The <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> component of the effect applies to <em>all</em> attack rolls including unarmed attacks, throwing items, and spells. When making one of these (non-weapon) attacks, the effect remains.</li>\n<li>The damage component applies to <a href=\"/wiki/Throwing\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Throwing\">thrown</a> weapons as well. Again, the effect is not lost when making a throwing attack, so Breezeswift Speed can be used buff the damage of all throwing attacks in a turn.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li><b>Breezeswift Speed</b> provides <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Swift_as_Wind_(Condition)\" title=\"Swift as Wind (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Generic_Force_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Force_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Generic_Force_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Force_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Generic_Force_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Force_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Swift as Wind\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Generic_Force_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Force_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/Generic_Force_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Swift_as_Wind_(Condition)\" title=\"Swift as Wind (Condition)\">Swift as Wind</a>, which is only removed when making a weapon attack, as opposed to the next attack roll.\n<ul><li>Breezeswift Speed states it affects the next \"Attack Roll\", while Swift As Wind states it affects the next \"weapon attack\".</li></ul></li>\n<li>While active, Swift As Wind affects all attack rolls but only increases weapon damage.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714194855\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.058 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.064 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2331/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24830/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9503/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 860535/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   54.280      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   54.280      1 -total\n 29.45%   15.987      6 Template:Icon_text\n 28.52%   15.480      5 Template:Icon_link\n 26.94%   14.621     25 Template:Trim\n 18.32%    9.945      1 Template:Condition\n 18.10%    9.822      1 Template:SAI\n 17.34%    9.413      8 Template:Ifempty\n 15.88%    8.619      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 12.57%    6.824      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28263-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714194855 and revision id 370185. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}